			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2566508">
									

<p>There's some interesting stuff in here, like the problems posed by being bilingual but being able to appear anywhere in the world. I'm not sure how I feel about how uncontained this is, though. I mean, you'd think the Foundation could come up with <em>some</em> kind of pattern to what's going on, and just leave the chat logs as a record of how they were able to establish containment or something. Good work with the Agent's communication, though, that felt very realistic. I just sort of feel like this should be Keter, and/or go in a slightly different direction at the end. I mean, &quot;I've been here before&quot; and a crosslink (that doesn't actually work, I should note) isn't a very strong ending.</p>

