<p>I can get passed the lack of actually containment procedures, primarily because of the online interactions between SCP-2644 and the agent. Skips like these need something to humanize the ordeal, and that provides it. Maybe it's not as eerie or grand as some would like it, but I appreciate it. Well done.</p>

